  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">안녕하세요</span><span style='letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 11pt;'>.. ^^</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">의정부에 있는 경기도과학교육원 북부기초과학교육관에서 올해 매달&nbsp;</span><span style='letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 11pt;'>1</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">회씩 선생님들께 도움이 되실 수 있는 주제로 교사 세미나를 시행하고 있습니다</span><span style='letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 11pt;'>. (</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">연수는 아닙니다</span><span style='letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 11pt;'>.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><span style='font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 11pt;'>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">북부기초과학교육관 교사연수신청 페이지</span><span style='letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 11pt;'>(&nbsp;<a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"http://ujb.gise.kr/train/check.asp\" target=\"_blank\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\">http://ujb.gise.kr/train/check.asp</font></u></a>&nbsp;)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">에서 신청가능하시고요</span><span style='letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 11pt;'>,</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">혹시 관심있는 주제가 있으시면 신청하시길 바랍니다</span><span style='letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 11pt;'>. ^^&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><span style='letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 11pt;'>(경기도교사가 아니신 분들은 여기에 댓글을 달고 오심됩니다.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">참가 신청은 매달 말부터 그 다음달 세미나 시작일까지 받습니다</span><span style='letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 11pt;'>. (</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">현재&nbsp;10</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">월 주제에 대한 신청을 받고 있습니다</span><span style='letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 11pt;'>.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\">관심있는 분들의&nbsp;많은 참여부탁드립니다~</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 255); line-height: 34.13px; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;'>&lt;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); line-height: 34.13px; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;\">전문적학습공동체 활성화를 위한 교사 세미나 실시&nbsp;</span><span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 255); line-height: 34.13px; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;'>&gt;&nbsp;</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; -ms-word-break: normal; -ms-word-wrap: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -23.8pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 23.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">가</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">일정</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;: <span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2015. 10. 21</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">.(수</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)&nbsp;18:30 ~ 20:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -23.8pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 23.8pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(과학교육원 행사 관계로 부득이하게 일정이 변경되었습니다.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -23.8pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 23.8pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">나. 장소: 경기도과학교육원 북부과학교육부(의정부 녹양동 소재)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -23.8pt; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 23.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">세미나 주제 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">과학 교사 동아리 운영</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -23.8pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 23.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">라</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">강사 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: <span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">정금자</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(대화</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">고등학교 교사</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -23.8pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 23.8pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style